# Personal financial data — NEVER commit these.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Your My Expenses export: every transaction, merchant and amount you have.
*.csv

# Generated from that export, and just as sensitive — it embeds the full
# transaction list as JSON. Rebuild it any time with `python3 spendlight.py`.
data.js

# Screenshots of the dashboard show real balances and salary figures.
# Keep the folder, but commit an image only after checking what is in it.
screenshots/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
!docs/demo-*.png

